# Distilled Design Patterns

Patterns distilled from references (RIE engine, references/engine.sdd).
Each pattern carries evidence level + source REF records.

Entry format:
  @pattern.<name>
    level: OBSERVED | INFERRED | VALIDATED | ADOPTED | STANDARD
    evidence: [REF-<n>, ...]
    confidence: high | medium | low
    project_fit: FIT | ADAPT | REJECT + reason
    recommended_for: L0..L5 (project scale)

State: +
